-    "debriefMsg": "Follow the procedures for routine induction of general anesthesia: \n1.  Administer a small dose of anxiolytic agent such as midazolam\n2.  Preoxygenate\n3.  Administer a small dose of opioid such as fentanyl to blunt the response to intubation\n4.  Administer lidocaine prior to propofol to reduce pain on injection\n5.  Administer a bolus of hypnotic agent such as propofol\n6.  Administer succinylcholine or other neuromuscular blocking agent to facilitate intubation\n7.  Intubate the trachea, confirm proper position of the endotracheal tube and establish positive pressure ventilation\n8.  Administer inhalation agent\n9.  Allow the surgeon to make incision when the patient has 1-1.5 MAC of anesthetic on board.", 
